// Run from the editor (F5): main() of the current base state in the same VM
// 
//  
// Edit - and the next launch goes to the new version (§9.3).
// program: editor_overloads.vish
open_view module
run 1.5\s2
// expect: output text="4\n2.25\n" ok=true
// output line - to its print, the signature "function: line" (frame "Run")
// expect: label="main:12"
// expect: label="main:13" now=·
// Body editing - the next launch is already with her
pointer 1 @* 1 1
key 1 Delete
key 1 -
// expect: area(i64 n) => n - n;
run 1.5\s2
// expect: output text="0\n2.25\n" ok=true
// Error of execution - output to it and the trace, ok=false
run 
// expect: ok=false
